<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 430" role="img" aria-labelledby="tb-t tb-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <title id="tb-t">Trust boundary for instructions</title>
    <desc id="tb-d">Only the user's direct chat and a small set of verified channels carry authority. Tool output, fetched pages, repository files and sub-agent replies are data. Data flows into the agent, but never upgrades to an instruction.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="tb-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="arrow" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <rect x="20" y="10" width="440" height="110" rx="10" class="zone auth" />
    <text x="36" y="34" class="zhead">Authority: may instruct</text>
    <rect x="40" y="52" width="190" height="52" rx="8" class="box hot" />
    <text x="135" y="82" class="label">Direct user chat</text>
    <rect x="250" y="52" width="190" height="52" rx="8" class="box hot" />
    <text x="345" y="76" class="label">Verified channel</text>
    <text x="345" y="94" class="sub">checked sender, one-to-one</text>

    <rect x="140" y="170" width="200" height="60" rx="8" class="box hot" />
    <text x="240" y="197" class="label">Agent</text>
    <text x="240" y="217" class="sub">acts on instructions only</text>

    <rect x="20" y="290" width="440" height="130" rx="10" class="zone data" />
    <text x="36" y="314" class="zhead">Data: informs, never instructs</text>
    <rect x="40" y="330" width="120" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="100" y="360" class="label">Tool output</text>
    <text x="100" y="380" class="sub">command results</text>
    <rect x="180" y="330" width="120" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="240" y="360" class="label">Web pages</text>
    <text x="240" y="380" class="sub">fetched content</text>
    <rect x="320" y="330" width="120" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="380" y="360" class="label">Repo files</text>
    <text x="380" y="380" class="sub">READMEs, issues</text>

    <path d="M240 120V168" class="line" marker-end="url(#tb-a)" />
    <path d="M240 288V232" class="line dash" marker-end="url(#tb-a)" />
    <text x="252" y="268" class="side">read as data</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Authority comes from a short list of channels. Everything the agent reads while working is data.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  svg { font-family: var(--sl-font-system); }
  .box { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6); stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .hot { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent); stroke-width: 2; }
  .zone { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .auth { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent); }
  .data { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
  .zhead { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .label { fill: var(--sl-color-text); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-anchor: middle; }
  .sub { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 12px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .side { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 12px; }
  .line { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .arrow { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
</style>
